#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/docusaurus.rst:57
msgid "Configuring Docusaurus and Read the Docs Addons"
msgstr "配置 Docusaurus 与 Read the Docs Addon"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/docusaurus.rst:59
msgid ""
"For optimal integration with Read the Docs, make the following optional "
"configuration changes to your Docusaurus config."
msgstr "为获得与 Read the Docs 的最佳集成效果，请对你的 Docusaurus 配置进行以下可选更改。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/docusaurus.rst:67
msgid "Configure trailing slashes"
msgstr "配置尾部斜杠"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/docusaurus.rst:69
msgid ""
"For proper operation on Read the Docs, you need to set ``trailingSlash: "
"true`` in your Docusaurus configuration. This ensures that URLs like "
"``/docs/intro`` are handled as ``/docs/intro/`` and the corresponding "
"``index.html`` file is served correctly."
msgstr ""
"为在 Read the Docs 上正常运行，你需要在 Docusaurus 配置中设置 ``trailingSlash: true``。这可确保像 "
"``/docs/intro`` 这样的 URL 被当作 ``/docs/intro/`` 处理，并正确提供相应的 ``index.html`` 文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/docusaurus.rst:72
msgid ""
"Without this setting (or if set to ``false``), you will need to configure "
"redirects to ensure proper URL resolution."
msgstr "如果不设置此项（或设置为 ``false``），你需要配置重定向以确保 URL 正确解析。"

