#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/docusaurus.rst:85
msgid ""
"A :doc:`canonical URL </canonical-urls>` allows you to specify the preferred"
" version of a web page to prevent duplicated content."
msgstr ":doc:`规范 URL </canonical-urls>` 允许你指定网页的首选版本，以防止内容重复。"

